{"unit_id":"cup113__dsh-effort-memory#card-zh","repo":"cup113/dsh-effort-memory","commit":"0100f3d0a6d675076bc15602cf87bc551a5a7251","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-memory 是一款面向 DeepSeek Harness（DSH）的主机端插件，会在会话切换模型时记住离开模型上正在生效的推理强度，并在返回时尝试恢复。它监听模型选择事件，按提供方和模型保存强度；目标模型仍支持该强度时，通过 DSH 的模型选择接口恢复。首次使用的模型保留自身默认值，能力不匹配时跳过恢复。它适合经常在不同模型间切换、希望保留各自推理强度偏好的 DSH 用户。持久存储可用时记忆跨重启保留，否则只在当前进程有效。安装后重启 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-21","index.js:279-338","decide.js:120-138"]}
{"unit_id":"cup113__dsh-effort-memory#card-en","repo":"cup113/dsh-effort-memory","commit":"0100f3d0a6d675076bc15602cf87bc551a5a7251","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-effort-memory is a DSH host plugin that remembers reasoning effort per provider and model. On a switch back, it restores the saved effort if the model supports it. New routes keep their default. DSH storage preserves preferences across restarts; without it, memory lasts only for this process.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-21","index.js:279-338","decide.js:120-138"]}
