{"unit_id":"cup113__dsh-effort-memory#feature-memory","repo":"cup113/dsh-effort-memory","commit":"0100f3d0a6d675076bc15602cf87bc551a5a7251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-memory 的功能「memory」：按模型记忆推理强度：插件以提供方和模型组成路由键，记录切换离开时正在生效的强度；若 DSH 持久存储可用，记录可跨重启保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:117-185"]}
{"unit_id":"cup113__dsh-effort-memory#feature-restore","repo":"cup113/dsh-effort-memory","commit":"0100f3d0a6d675076bc15602cf87bc551a5a7251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-memory 的功能「restore」：切回模型时恢复偏好：会话切换到曾用过的模型后，插件先检查该模型当前公布的推理档位，再通过模型选择接口恢复仍受支持的强度。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:279-301"]}
{"unit_id":"cup113__dsh-effort-memory#feature-capability","repo":"cup113/dsh-effort-memory","commit":"0100f3d0a6d675076bc15602cf87bc551a5a7251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-memory 的功能「capability」：尊重模型能力和默认值：首次访问的模型、没有推理能力的模型，或不再支持已记忆档位的模型，都保留当前选择，不执行恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["decide.js:120-138"]}
{"unit_id":"cup113__dsh-effort-memory#feature-session","repo":"cup113/dsh-effort-memory","commit":"0100f3d0a6d675076bc15602cf87bc551a5a7251","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-memory 的功能「session」：跨重启识别会话原模型：会话创建时可从模型选择投影取得原路由，帮助插件识别重启后的首次切换；该投影不可用时首次切换只建立基准。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:204-228"]}
